# E1: the eight-seat best-levers arm c2-packed-tp4-8-best (gate only; never attached on hardware) as an ATTACH and exactness smoke: eight seats on two 64-row M3 blocks plus the nine levers and the pair
# drafts. This profile keeps the verify audits off (QWEN_FAST_VERIFY_T1_AUDIT and T2 are 0); what it audits is attach (the pool, the capture headroom) and exactness by text. E1 and E2 run IDENTICAL tests
# and differ only in QWEN_FAST_QUAD_DRAFT_BLOCKS, so E1 is E2's paired control. The fused commit logs one engaged line per M3 block (two here).
# READ: the attach completes with no refusal, c2_smoke_check clean, concurrent4 and concurrent4_code_equal equal to solo (block A, judged in-job) and equal to BS's concurrent4_code_equal hashes, concurrent8_code and
# concurrent8_code_equal complete with every user at budget, concurrent8_steady, concurrent5_split and concurrent8_drain complete, no stall. Block B's texts are the reference E2 and E3 are compared to (no eight-user solo
# reference exists in this window). Record per request the accepted tokens and the verify-round count for E2's paired check. An attach refusal or a capture-headroom refusal is the finding to record by name. Duration (estimate): 120 min. Soft.
# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the tp4/next-5 four-card development window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/next-5 and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a
# registry: the cards are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from this branch by its author.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-next-5a is what B0 builds from the pushed tp4/next-5 commit; every later job serves that one image. A commit of a
# file the image carries needs a new B0 build and a new tag in every template. The cards are under development: this window never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-next-5a
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8-best
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,coding,concurrent4_solo,concurrent4,concurrent4_code_equal,concurrent8_code,concurrent8_code_equal,concurrent8_steady,concurrent5_split,concurrent8_drain
